      <h1 class="u-display mt-4 max-w-3xl text-section">
        Most data problems are not modelling problems. They are
        <em class="not-italic text-ultra">provenance</em> problems.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
        Nearly every failed reporting project I have been called into failed the same way:
        the number on the dashboard was wrong, nobody could say why, and by the time anyone
        traced it back the trust was gone. The model was fine. The lineage was not.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="hidden lg:block">
