          <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
            Two years and eight months across BI consulting and tax technology. The recurring job was the same:
            take data locked inside BMD, Business Central or SAP, and turn it into something a
            controller could act on without re-keying it. Automation with RPA and Alteryx got the
