    <p class="u-eyebrow lg:pt-1.5">Where I fit</p>
    <div class="u-prose text-ink-2">
      <p>
        I am most useful where a platform strategy has to survive contact with a real
        migration — regulated industries, manufacturing, finance, the public sector. Places
        where a wrong number has a cost attached and someone eventually asks to see the
        derivation.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Based in Upper Austria, working across Linz, Wels and Vienna, and remote with
        distributed teams. If that sounds like your problem,
        <a href="/consulting/" class="u-link">here is how engagements usually start</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

